{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhonghua-e-o133","title":"受禅后朝臣并受爵位，华歆以形色忤时，徙为司徒而不进爵","accounts":[{"id":"zhonghua-a-ed626891e00f625555b3","label":"裴注·华峤谱叙","text":"受禅后朝臣并受爵位，华歆以形色忤时，徙为司徒而不进爵","evidence":["zhonghua-q-1b1de4a6b1382d1d3054"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-5b747379ae1ef63113d4","label":"裴注·华峤谱叙","text":"文帝久不怿问尚书令陈群，群离席长跪答以曾臣汉朝义形其色、惧陛下实应且憎，帝大悦遂重异之","evidence":["zhonghua-q-98664bf91803471bc3fc"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0340","role":"以形色忤时者；所议之相国","evidence":["zhonghua-q-1b1de4a6b1382d1d3054","zhonghua-q-98664bf91803471bc3fc"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"发问而悦者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-98664bf91803471bc3fc"]},{"person":"wudi-p0394","role":"长跪答对者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-98664bf91803471bc3fc"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-1b1de4a6b1382d1d3054","zhonghua-q-98664bf91803471bc3fc"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhonghua-q-1b1de4a6b1382d1d3054","source_order":[13,190,50],"order":2889}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0340","name":"华歆","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0394","name":"陈群","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhonghua-q-1b1de4a6b1382d1d3054","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-b647fae24bfea7ccc1f0","layer":"pei","quote":"朝臣三公以下，并受爵位。歆以形色忤时，徙为司徒，而不进爵。","attribution":"裴注·华峤谱叙","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":189,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-58cbf5044cca12754f4e","start":50,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-98664bf91803471bc3fc","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-b647fae24bfea7ccc1f0","layer":"pei","quote":"魏文帝久不怿，以问尚书令陈群曰：‘我应天受禅，百辟群后，莫不人人悦喜，形于声色；而相国及公独有不怡者，何也？’群起，离席长跪，曰：‘臣与相国，曾臣汉朝，心虽悦喜，义形其色；亦惧陛下实应且憎。’帝大悦，遂重异之。”","attribution":"裴注·华峤谱叙","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":189,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-58cbf5044cca12754f4e","start":79,"end":185,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
